sim/microduck/microduck_sim.py and sim/microduck/server.py port the control loop of Pollen Robotics' Microduck playground
(https://huggingface.co/spaces/pollen-robotics/microduck-simulator, app/src/game/game.js and constants.js:
observation layout, default pose, action scaling, 50 Hz loop, kick/sit/fall-recovery state machine).
That work is Copyright Pollen Robotics and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the files in sim/microduck/
are therefore also distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0),
with modifications by Arca Computer, Inc. (headless Python/onnxruntime port, HTTP API, ball-approach controller,
turn controller, replay renderer).

The Microduck robot model (MJCF, meshes) and the trained ONNX policies are NOT included in this repository.
sim/microduck/fetch_assets.py downloads them from the Hugging Face Space above; they come from
https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck and https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl (Apache-2.0).
Microduck is a Pollen Robotics / Hugging Face project; this plugin is an independent community integration.

backends/ros.py, backends/rosbridge_client.py, imaging.py and scripts/ros_demo/ come from arcabotai/hermes-ros (MIT),
and backends/microduck.py from arcabotai/hermes-microduck (MIT), both by Arca Computer, Inc.
